		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt’s a stone tablet that boosts\nthe power of Psychic-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00308" index="308">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt’s a stone tablet that boosts\nthe power of Bug-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00309" index="309">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt’s a stone tablet that boosts\nthe power of Rock-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00310" index="310">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt’s a stone tablet that boosts\nthe power of Ghost-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00311" index="311">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt’s a stone tablet that boosts\nthe power of Dragon-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00312" index="312">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt’s a stone tablet that boosts\nthe power of Dark-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00313" index="313">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt’s a stone tablet that boosts\nthe power of Steel-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00314" index="314">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis incense has a curious aroma that\nboosts the power of Psychic-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00315" index="315">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis incense has a curious aroma that\nboosts the power of Rock-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00316" index="316">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis incense has a curious aroma that\nmakes the holder move slower than usual.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00317" index="317">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis incense has a curious aroma that\nboosts the power of Water-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00318" index="318">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis incense has a curious aroma that\nboosts the power of Grass-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00319" index="319">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt doubles any prize money received as long\nas the holder joins the battle at least once.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00320" index="320">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt helps keep wild Pokémon away when\nthe holder is the head of the party.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00321" index="321">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A protective item of some sort.\nIt is extremely stiff and heavy.\nIt’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00322" index="322">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A box packed with a tremendous amount\nof electric energy.\nIt’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00323" index="323">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A box packed with a tremendous amount\nof magma energy.\nIt’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00324" index="324">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A transparent device overflowing with\ndubious data.\nIt’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00325" index="325">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cloth imbued with horrifyingly strong\nspiritual energy.\nIt’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00326" index="326">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis sharply hooked claw boosts the\ncritical-hit ratio of the holder’s moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00327" index="327">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nWhen the holder successfully inflicts\ndamage, the target may also flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00328" index="328">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user focuses its mind before\nlaunching this attack. It will fail\nif the user is hit before it is used.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00329" index="329">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sharp, huge claws hook and slash\nthe foe quickly and with great\npower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00330" index="330">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with a pulsing blast\nof water. It may also confuse the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00331" index="331">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user quietly focuses its mind and\ncalms its spirit to raise its Sp. Atk\nand Sp. Def stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00332" index="332">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is scared off, to be replaced\nby another Pokémon in its party.\nIn the wild, the battle ends.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00333" index="333">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A move that leaves the foe badly\npoisoned. This poison damage\nworsens every turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00334" index="334">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Summons a hailstorm that lasts for\nfive turns. The hailstorm damages\nall types except Ice.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00335" index="335">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tenses its muscles to bulk up\nits body, boosting both its Attack and\nDefense stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00336" index="336">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user forcefully shoots seeds at\nthe foe. Two to five seeds are shot in\nrapid succession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00337" index="337">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A variable move that changes type\nand power depending on the hidden\nability of the Pokémon using it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00338" index="338">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user intensifies the sun for\nfive turns, powering up Fire-type\nmoves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00339" index="339">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is taunted into a rage that\nallows it to use only attack moves for\ntwo to four turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00340" index="340">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is struck with an icy-cold\nbeam of energy. It may also freeze\nthe target solid.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00341" index="341">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A howling blizzard is summoned to\nstrike the foe. It may also freeze\nthe target solid.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00342" index="342">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked with a powerful\nbeam. The user must rest on the next\nturn to regain its energy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00343" index="343">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wondrous wall of light is put up to\nsuppress damage from special attacks\nfor five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00344" index="344">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It enables the user to evade all\nattacks. Its chance of failing rises\nif it is used in succession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00345" index="345">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user summons a heavy rain that\nfalls for five turns, powering up\nWater-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00346" index="346">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nutrient-draining attack. The user’s\nHP is restored by half the damage\ntaken by the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00347" index="347">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a protective field\nthat prevents status problems like\npoison, paralysis, burn, and sleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00348" index="348">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A full-power attack that grows more\npowerful the less the user likes its\nTrainer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00349" index="349">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A two-turn attack. The user gathers\nlight, then blasts a bundled beam on\nthe second turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00350" index="350">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slammed with a sturdy\ntail of steel. It may also lower the\ntarget’s Defense stat if it hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00351" index="351">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A strong electric blast is loosed at\nthe foe. It may also leave the foe\nparalyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00352" index="352">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wicked thunderbolt is dropped on the\nfoe to inflict damage. It may also\nleave the target paralyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00353" index="353">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user sets off an earthquake\nthat hits all the Pokémon in the\nbattle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00354" index="354">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A full-power attack that grows more\npowerful the more the user likes its\nTrainer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00355" index="355">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user burrows, then attacks on the\nsecond turn. It can also be used to\nexit dungeons.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00356" index="356">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit by a strong telekinetic\nforce. It may also reduce the foe’s\nSp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00357" index="357">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurls a shadowy blob at the\nfoe. It may also lower the foe’s\nSp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00358" index="358">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with tough fists,\netc. It can also break any barrier\nsuch as Light Screen and Reflect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00359" index="359">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user begins moving so quickly\nthat it creates illusory copies to\nraise its evasiveness.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00360" index="360">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wondrous wall of light is put up to\nsuppress damage from physical attacks\nfor five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00361" index="361">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user strikes the foe with a quick\njolt of electricity. This attack cannot\nbe evaded.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00362" index="362">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is scorched with an intense\nblast of fire. The target may also be\nleft with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00363" index="363">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Unsanitary sludge is hurled at\nthe foe. It may also poison the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00364" index="364">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A five-turn sandstorm is summoned\nto hurt all combatants except the\nRock, Ground, and Steel types.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00365" index="365">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked with an intense\nblast of all-consuming fire. It may\nalso leave the target with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00366" index="366">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Large boulders are hurled at the foe\nto inflict damage. It lowers the foe’s\nSpeed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00367" index="367">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user confounds the foe with speed,\nthen strikes. The attack lands without\nfail.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00368" index="368">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user torments and enrages the\nfoe, making it incapable of using the\nsame move twice in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00369" index="369">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that doubles its power\nif the user is poisoned, paralyzed, or\nhas a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00370" index="370">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move with effects that\nvary depending on the user’s\nenvironment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00371" index="371">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user goes to sleep for two\nturns. It fully restores the user’s HP\nand heals any status problem.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00372" index="372">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it is the opposite gender of the\nuser, the foe becomes infatuated\nand less likely to attack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00373" index="373">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks and steals the foe’s\nheld item simultaneously. It can’t\nsteal if the user holds an item.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00374" index="374">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with wings of steel.\nIt may also raise the user’s Defense\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00375" index="375">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user employs its psychic power to\nexchange abilities with the foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00376" index="376">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user steals the effects of any\nhealing or status-changing move the\nfoe attempts to use.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00377" index="377">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the foe at full\npower using fiery energy. It also\nsharply reduces the user’s Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00378" index="378">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lands and rests its body.\nIt restores the user’s HP by up to\nhalf of its max HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00379" index="379">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks at full power.\nIt may also lower the foe’s Sp. Def\nstat if it hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00380" index="380">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user draws power from nature and\nfires it at the foe. It may also lower\nthe target’s Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00381" index="381">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A restrained attack that prevents the\nfoe from fainting. The target is left\nwith at least 1 HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00382" index="382">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the foe’s HP is down to under half,\nthis attack will hit with double the\npower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00383" index="383">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user flings its held item at the\nfoe to attack. Its power and effects\ndepend on the item.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00384" index="384">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with an electric\ncharge. The user may use any remaining\nelectricity to raise its Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00385" index="385">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user endures any attack, leaving\n1 HP. Its chance of failing rises if it\nis used in succession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00386" index="386">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked with a shock\nwave generated by the user’s gaping\nmouth.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00387" index="387">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An energy-draining punch. The user’s\nHP is restored by half the damage\ntaken by the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00388" index="388">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots a sinister, bluish\nwhite flame at the foe to inflict a\nburn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00389" index="389">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked with powdery\nscales blown by wind. It may also\nraise all the user’s stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00390" index="390">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It prevents the foe from using its\nheld item. Its Trainer is also\nprevented from using items on it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00391" index="391">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user explodes to inflict damage on\nall Pokémon in battle. The user faints\nupon using this move.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00392" index="392">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slashes with a sharp claw\nmade from shadows. It has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00393" index="393">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stores power, then attacks.\nIf the user can use this attack after\nthe foe, its power is doubled.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00394" index="394">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user recycles a single-use item\nthat has been used in battle so it can\nbe used again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00395" index="395">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user charges the foe using every\nbit of its power. It must rest on the\nnext turn to recover.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00396" index="396">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user polishes its body to reduce\ndrag. It sharply raises the Speed\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00397" index="397">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user flashes a light that cuts the\nfoe’s accuracy. It can also be used to\nilluminate caves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00398" index="398">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stabs the foe with a\nsharpened stone from below. It has\na high critical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00399" index="399">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that inflicts double\nthe damage if the user has been hurt\nby the foe in the same turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00400" index="400">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A weak electric charge is launched\nat the foe. It causes paralysis if it\nhits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00401" index="401">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tackles the foe from a\nhigh-speed spin. The slower the user,\nthe greater the damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00402" index="402">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A frenetic dance to uplift the fighting\nspirit. It sharply raises the user’s\nAttack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00403" index="403">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lays a trap of levitating\nstones around the foe. The trap hurts\nfoes that switch into battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00404" index="404">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hypnotizes itself into\ncopying any stat change made\nby the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00405" index="405">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it is the opposite gender of the\nuser, the foe is charmed into sharply\nlowering its Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00406" index="406">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user releases a horrible aura\nimbued with dark thoughts. It may also\nmake the target flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00407" index="407">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Large boulders are hurled at the foe\nto inflict damage. It may also make the\ntarget flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00408" index="408">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slashes at the foe by\ncrossing its scythes or claws as if\nthey were a pair of scissors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00409" index="409">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">While it is asleep, the user\nrandomly uses one of the moves\nit knows.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00410" index="410">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user draws power from the Berry\nit is holding to attack. The Berry\ndetermines its type and power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00411" index="411">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is stabbed with a tentacle or\narm steeped with poison. It may also\npoison the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00412" index="412">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack that works only on a\nsleeping foe. It absorbs half the\ndamage caused to heal the user’s HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00413" index="413">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user snares the foe with grass\nand trips it. The heavier the foe, the\ngreater the damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00414" index="414">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user enrages the foe into\nconfusion. However, it also sharply\nraises the foe’s Attack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00415" index="415">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user pecks the foe. If the foe is\nholding a Berry, the user plucks it and\ngains its effect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00416" index="416">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">After making its attack, the user\nrushes back to switch places with a\nparty Pokémon in waiting.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00417" index="417">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user makes a copy of itself using\nsome of its HP. The copy serves as\nthe user’s decoy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00418" index="418">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user gathers all its light energy\nand releases it in one shot. It may\nalso lower the foe’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00419" index="419">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a bizarre space in\nwhich slower Pokémon get to move\nfirst for five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00420" index="420">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is cut with a scythe or a claw.\nIt can also be used to cut down thin\ntrees.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00421" index="421">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user soars, then strikes on the\nsecond turn. It can also be used to\nfly to any familiar town.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00422" index="422">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It swamps the entire battlefield with\na giant wave. It can also be used\nto cross water.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00423" index="423">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slugged with a punch thrown\nat maximum power. It can also be used\nto move boulders.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00424" index="424">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Traps foes in a violent swirling\nwhirlpool. It can also be used to\ntraverse whirlpools.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00425" index="425">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slugs the foe with a\nshattering punch. It can also smash\ncracked boulders.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00426" index="426">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user charges the foe at an\nawesome speed. It can also be used\nto climb a waterfall.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00427" index="427">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A charging attack that may also leave\nthe foe confused. It can also be used\nto scale rocky walls.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00428" index="428">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A bag filled with convenient tools for\nexploring. It provides access to the\nUnderground in the Sinnoh region.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00429" index="429">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A sturdy, spacious bag that is used\nto carry any treasures or loot\nobtained in the coal mine.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00430" index="430">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It lists the rules for holding battles.\nFor Link Battles, you may choose which\nset of rules you wish to use.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00431" index="431">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A tool that can search out Pokémon\nthat are hiding in the tall grass.\nIts battery is recharged as you walk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00432" index="432">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A card that lists how many Battle\nPoints you have earned.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00433" index="433">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A notebook that keeps a record of\nyour adventure so far.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00434" index="434">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A case for storing Stickers that can\nbe applied to Ball Capsules.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00435" index="435">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wondrous, pretty case to store\nlots of colorful Props for your\nPokémon to wear in a musical.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00436" index="436">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A tiny bag that can hold 10 Stickers\nfor decorating Ball Capsules.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00437" index="437">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A convenient notepad that is used to\nregister your friends and keep a\nrecord of your gameplay.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00438" index="438">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A large key for operating the doors of\nthe Valley Windworks in the canyon.\nIt was held by a Team Galactic Grunt.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00439" index="439">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An ancient good-luck charm made of\nPokémon bones to be taken to the\nelder of Celestic Town.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00440" index="440">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A card key for disengaging the security\nsystems in the Galactic HQ. Losing it\ncan result in punishment, apparently.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00441" index="441">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mythical chain that is said to\nbind the Legendary Pokémon that\ncreated the Sinnoh region.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00442" index="442">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A very convenient map that can be\nviewed anytime. It even shows you\nyour present location in the region.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00443" index="443">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A device that indicates Trainers who\nwant to battle.\nIts battery charges while you walk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00444" index="444">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A case for holding coins obtained at the\nGame Corner.\nIt can hold up to 50,000 coins.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00445" index="445">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An old and beat-up fishing rod.\nUse it at bodies of water to fish\nfor Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00446" index="446">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A new, good-quality fishing rod.\nUse it at bodies of water to fish\nfor Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00447" index="447">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An awesome, high-spec fishing rod.\nUse it at bodies of water to fish\nfor Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00448" index="448">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A watering can shaped like a Psyduck.\nIt helps promote the healthy growth\nof any Berries planted in good, soft soil.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00449" index="449">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A case for storing Poffins cooked\nfrom Berries.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00450" index="450">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A folding bike that enables a rider\nto get around much faster than with\nRunning Shoes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00451" index="451">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A key to one of the suites at a certain\nluxury hotel by a lake.\nFor some odd reason, it often disappears.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00452" index="452">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A letter from Professor Oak.\nWritten in it is a request\nfor you to go to Route 224.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00453" index="453">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A feather that glows like the moon.\nIt’s said to possess the power to\ndispel nightmares.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00454" index="454">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A card needed for entering the inn\nin Canalave City. Oddly, the last\ndate marked on it was 50 years ago.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00455" index="455">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flute that puts out echoing sounds\nthat do not seem to be of this world.\nNo one knows who made it or when.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00456" index="456">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A ticket required for sailing on\nthe high-speed ferry S.S. Aqua.\nIt has a drawing of a ship on it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00457" index="457">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pass required for entering Pokémon\nContests. It has a drawing of an\naward ribbon on its front.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00458" index="458">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A stone formed by boulders melting in\nintensely hot magma, then hardening.\nMagma remains sealed inside it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00459" index="459">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A parcel entrusted into your care.\nYou’re supposed to deliver it to your\nchildhood friend who left Twinleaf Town.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00460" index="460">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A coupon to be exchanged for a\nPokémon Watch- Pokétch for short.\nThree coupons are needed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00461" index="461">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A coupon to be exchanged for a\nPokémon Watch- Pokétch for short.\nThree coupons are needed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00462" index="462">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A coupon to be exchanged for a\nPokémon Watch- Pokétch for short.\nThree coupons are needed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00463" index="463">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The key to Team Galactic’s sinister\nwarehouse located at the edge of\nVeilstone City.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00464" index="464">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fantastic medicine dispensed by the\npharmacy in Cianwood City.\nIt fully heals a Pokémon of any ailment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00465" index="465">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An amazing device that can record a\nbattle between friends or the battles\nat certain special battle facilities.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00466" index="466">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flower sometimes bundled in\nbouquets to convey gratitude on\nspecial occasions, such as birthdays.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00467" index="467">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A high-tech key that has to be used at\na specific location. It emits a special\nelectronic signal to open a door.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00468" index="468">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A handy box where you can store up\nto 99 of each kind of Apricorn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00469" index="469">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A report of all the discovered kinds\nof Unown.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00470" index="470">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Portable containers that allow you\nto easily cultivate Berries anywhere\nand anytime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00471" index="471">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The latest device for showing the\nlocation of hidden items.\nIt’s worn on the head when in use.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00472" index="472">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A card to save points for the\nBuena’s Password show.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00473" index="473">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A very tasty tail of something.\nIt can be sold at a high price to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00474" index="474">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A very old-fashioned bell that makes\na gentle ringing sound.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00475" index="475">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A card key that opens a shutter in\nthe Radio Tower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00476" index="476">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A key that opens a door in the\nGoldenrod Tunnel.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00477" index="477">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A bottle used for watering plants in\nthe Berry Pots.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00478" index="478">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A scale from a red Gyarados that\nappeared at the Lake of Rage.\nIt glows red like a flame.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00479" index="479">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Mime Jr. doll that was lost by\nthe Copycat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00480" index="480">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pass required for riding the Magnet Train.\nIt allows you to ride whenever and however\nmuch you’d like.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00481" index="481">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An important part of a machine that\nwas stolen from the Power Plant.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00482" index="482">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A strange feather that gleams with a\nsilvery color.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00483" index="483">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A strange feather that gleams in\nrainbow colors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00484" index="484">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An Egg obtained from Mr. Pokémon.\nIt has a mysterious pattern on it,\nand what is in the Egg is unknown.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00485" index="485">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A red Apricorn.\nIt has a pungent scent that assails the\nnostrils.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00486" index="486">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A yellow Apricorn.\nIt has a light, refreshing scent.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00487" index="487">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A blue Apricorn.\nIt has a slightly grassy smell to it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00488" index="488">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A green Apricorn.\nIt has a mysterious and aromatic scent.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00489" index="489">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pink Apricorn.\nIt has a pleasantly sweet scent.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00490" index="490">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A white Apricorn.\nIt doesn’t have any aroma at all.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00491" index="491">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A black Apricorn.\nIt has a smell that cannot be captured\nin words.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00492" index="492">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat different Poké Ball that is\nmore effective when catching Pokémon\nthat are usually very quick to run away.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00493" index="493">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nbecomes more effective the lower the\nlevel of the Pokémon compared to your own.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00494" index="494">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat different Poké Ball that is\nmore effective when catching Pokémon\nin or on the water.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00495" index="495">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nbecomes more effective the heavier\nthe Pokémon is.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00496" index="496">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat different Poké Ball that is\nmore effective when catching Pokémon\nof the opposite gender to your own.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00497" index="497">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nmakes a wild Pokémon more friendly\ntoward you immediately.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00498" index="498">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat different Poké Ball that is\nmore effective when catching Pokémon\nthat can be evolved using a Moon Stone.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00499" index="499">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A special Poké Ball that is used\nduring the Bug-Catching Contest.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00500" index="500">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A special Poké Ball used in the Pal\nPark.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00501" index="501">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nice photo album for storing all\nthe photos taken along your\nadventure.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00502" index="502">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A music player that allows you to listen\nto nostalgic songs. It’s operated with\nthe flip of a single switch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00503" index="503">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A very old-fashioned bell that makes\na gentle ringing sound.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00504" index="504">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mahogany Town’s famous candy.\nMany tourists like to buy them\nto take home.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00505" index="505">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It holds Pokéathlon records. It is a\ncard that shows how many victories\nyou have had in the Pokéathlon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00506" index="506">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
