		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A shiny blue orb that is said\nto have a deep connection to\na legend of the Hoenn region.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00536" index="536">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A crystal ball that was excavated from\nthe ground. It is covered with bits of rock\nand earth, but it is still very beautiful.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00537" index="537">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A glassy black stone that produces\na sharp cutting edge when split.\nIt’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00538" index="538">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A block of muddy material that can be\nused as fuel for burning when it is dried.\nIt’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00539" index="539">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A peculiar apple that can make a\ncertain species of Pokémon evolve.\nIt’s exceptionally tart.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00540" index="540">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A peculiar apple that can make a\ncertain species of Pokémon evolve.\nIt’s exceptionally sweet.</language>
