		<language name="English">A mysterious orb containing the\npower of the Unova region, to be\nused when generating Pass Power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00605" index="605">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat different Poké Ball that\nis more effective when catching\nPokémon that are asleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00606" index="606">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A toy that attracts the attention of\nPokémon. It guarantees escape from\nany battle with wild Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00607" index="607">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wondrous, pretty case to store\nlots of colorful Props for your\nPokémon to wear in a musical.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00608" index="608">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The skull of a Pokémon that was said\nto have braved the raging seas to\nfly around the world.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00609" index="609">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A rare mushroom that gives off a\nnice fragrance. It can be sold at a\nhigh price to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00610" index="610">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A big nugget of pure gold that gives\noff a lustrous gleam.\nIt can be sold at a high price to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00611" index="611">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Very large pearls that have a nice silvery\nsheen to them.\nThey can be sold at a high price to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00612" index="612">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A shard that fell to the ground when a\ncomet passed nearby.\nIt can be sold at a high price to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00613" index="613">
