	<row id="msg_0221_00644" index="644">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It can be used many times to greatly\nraise a Pokémon’s critical-hit ratio.\nIt wears off if the Pokémon is withdrawn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00645" index="645">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Reshiram’s body was destroyed and\nchanged into this stone. It is said to\nbe waiting for the emergence of a hero.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00646" index="646">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Zekrom’s body was destroyed and\nchanged into this stone. It is said to\nbe waiting for the emergence of a hero.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00647" index="647">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user gathers all its light energy\nand releases it at once. It may also\nlower the foe’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00648" index="648">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user releases a horrible aura\nimbued with dark thoughts. It may\nalso make the target flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00649" index="649">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A blood-draining attack. The user’s\nHP is restored by half the damage\ntaken by the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00650" index="650">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A high-tech transceiver with a camera\nfunction.\nIt allows up to four-way calls.</language>
