	<row id="msg_0221_00657" index="657">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A splicer that fuses Kyurem and a certain\nPokémon.\nThey are said to have originally been one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00658" index="658">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A splicer that separates Kyurem\nand a certain Pokémon when\nthey have been fused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00659" index="659">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A permit that is needed to enter the\nNature Preserve, a place that not\nmany people know about.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00660" index="660">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Having one of these mysterious oval\ncharms makes it more likely Pokémon\nEggs will be found at the Day Care.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00661" index="661">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Having one of these mysterious shining\ncharms makes it more likely you’ll\nencounter Shiny Pokémon in the wild.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00662" index="662">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A card key needed to enter the\npassword inside the Plasma Frigate.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00663" index="663">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A handkerchief dropped by a regular\nat Nacrene City’s Café Warehouse.\nIt smells faintly like a Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00664" index="664">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A special device that wrings out the\npotential of Pokémon.\nIt’s an imperfect prototype.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00665" index="665">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Xtransceiver found at the\nNimbasa City amusement park.\nIt seems it belongs to a boy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00666" index="666">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Xtransceiver found at the\nNimbasa City amusement park.\nIt seems it belongs to a girl.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00667" index="667">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious looking glass that reveals\nthe truth. It can return a Pokémon to\nits original shape.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00668" index="668">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nAttack and Sp. Atk sharply increase if\nthe holder is hit by a move it’s weak to.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00669" index="669">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis offensive vest raises Sp. Def\nbut prevents the use of status moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00670" index="670">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A device that allows you to view the\nhologram clips you have received at\nany time.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00671" index="671">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A letter that Professor Sycamore wrote\nto your mother. A faint but pleasant\nperfume seems to cling to the paper.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00672" index="672">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Attaches roller skates to the bottom\nof your shoes, allowing you to glide\nquickly around and perform tricks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00673" index="673">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt’s a stone tablet that boosts\nthe power of Fairy-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00674" index="674">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A capsule that allows a Pokémon to\nswitch its current Ability to the\nother Ability its species can have.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00675" index="675">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A soft and sweet treat made of fluffy,\npuffy, whipped, and whirled cream.\nIt’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
