		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A sachet filled with fragrant perfumes\nthat are just slightly overwhelming.\nYet it’s loved by a certain Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00677" index="677">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nBoosts Sp. Def if the holder is hit by\na Water-type attack--but only once.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00678" index="678">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
