	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01107" index="1107">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThese sausages should be\nboiled before eating.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01108" index="1108">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThe tinned food that Bob sells\nis curiously popular in Galar.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01109" index="1109">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThe tinned food that Bach sells\nis curiously popular in Galar.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01110" index="1110">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rWhen simmered, the beans suffuse\na dish with their mild flavor.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01111" index="1111">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rAn indispensable tool for\nmopping up that extra curry\nleft on your plate.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01112" index="1112">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThese flour noodles make for a\nsurprisingly good match with curry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01113" index="1113">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThe chewy texture of the\nmushrooms transforms\nany dish they’re added to.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01114" index="1114">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rWhen a Slowpoke’s tail falls off,\nit grows back quickly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01115" index="1115">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rWhether this is the kind of\nvegetable stalk that Farfetch’d\nlike is unknown.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01116" index="1116">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rAn apple chosen above others.\nIt has spectacular form and\na brilliant sheen.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01117" index="1117">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThe taste boiled off from the\nbones is sure to give a dish\na light umami taste.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01118" index="1118">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rPotatoes help mellow out a\nspicy taste, to make a dish\nmore mild.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01119" index="1119">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThough carelessly picked,\nthese herbs can add a\nfragrant accent to a dish.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01120" index="1120">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThe assortment of vegetables\nlooks quite appealing and\nhealthy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01121" index="1121">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rIt’s been a while since it was\nfried, so it’s gotten greasy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01122" index="1122">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rEven just one boiled egg can\nreally enhance a dish.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01123" index="1123">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everything you need to set up a tent\nand get cooking in a Wild Area or at\na camping spot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01124" index="1124">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">- - -</language>
