	<row id="msg_0221_01126" index="1126">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It is said that a hero used this sword to\nhalt a terrible disaster in ancient times.\nBut it’s grown rusty and worn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01127" index="1127">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It is said that a hero used this shield to\nhalt a terrible disaster in ancient times.\nBut it’s grown rusty and worn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01128" index="1128">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fossil piece left behind by a prehistoric\nPokémon that once soared through the sky.\nWhat it looked like is a mystery.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01129" index="1129">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fossil piece left behind by a prehistoric\nPokémon that once lived in the sea.\nWhat it looked like is a mystery.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01130" index="1130">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fossil piece left behind by a prehistoric\nPokémon that once roamed the land.\nWhat it looked like is a mystery.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01131" index="1131">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fossil piece left behind by a prehistoric\nPokémon that once lived in the sea.\nWhat it looked like is a mystery.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01132" index="1132">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A strawberry-shaped sweet.\nWhen a Milcery holds this,\nit spins around happily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01133" index="1133">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A heart-shaped sweet.\nWhen a Milcery holds this,\nit spins around happily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01134" index="1134">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A berry-shaped sweet.\nWhen a Milcery holds this,\nit spins around happily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01135" index="1135">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A clover-shaped sweet.\nWhen a Milcery holds this,\nit spins around happily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01136" index="1136">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flower-shaped sweet.\nWhen a Milcery holds this,\nit spins around happily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01137" index="1137">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A star-shaped sweet.\nWhen a Milcery holds this,\nit spins around happily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01138" index="1138">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A ribbon-shaped sweet.\nWhen a Milcery holds this,\nit spins around happily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01139" index="1139">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIf the holder uses a sound-based move,\nthis throat spray boosts its Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01140" index="1140">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIf the holder’s stats are lowered,\nit will be switched out of battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01141" index="1141">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThese boots protect the holder from the\neffects of traps set on the battlefield.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01142" index="1142">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIf the holder misses due to low accuracy,\nthis policy will sharply boost its Speed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01143" index="1143">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIf Trick Room takes effect, this item\nwill lower the holder’s Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01144" index="1144">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis umbrella protects the holder from\nthe effects of rain and harsh sunlight.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01145" index="1145">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A candy that is packed with energy.\nIf consumed, it grants a Pokémon a\nvery small number of Exp. Points.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01146" index="1146">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A candy that is packed with energy.\nIf consumed, it grants a Pokémon a\nsmall number of Exp. Points.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01147" index="1147">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A candy that is packed with energy.\nIf consumed, it grants a Pokémon a\nmoderate number of Exp. Points.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01148" index="1148">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A candy that is packed with energy.\nIf consumed, it grants a Pokémon a\nlarge number of Exp. Points.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01149" index="1149">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A candy that is packed with energy.\nIf consumed, it grants a Pokémon a\nvery large number of Exp. Points.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01150" index="1150">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A candy that is packed with energy.\nIf consumed, it raises the Dynamax Level\nof a Pokémon by one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01151" index="1151">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A frenetic dance to uplift the\nfighting spirit. This sharply raises\nthe user’s Attack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01152" index="1152">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user drops onto the target with\nits full body weight. This may also\nleave the target with paralysis.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01153" index="1153">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is scorched with an\nintense blast of fire. This may also\nleave the target with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01154" index="1154">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is blasted by a huge\nvolume of water launched under great\npressure.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01155" index="1155">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks everything around\nit by swamping its surroundings with\na giant wave.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01156" index="1156">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is struck with an\nicy-cold beam of energy. This may\nalso leave the target frozen.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01157" index="1157">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A howling blizzard is summoned to strike\nopposing Pokémon. This may also leave\nthe opposing Pokémon frozen.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01158" index="1158">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A powerful low kick that makes the target\nfall over. The heavier the target, the\ngreater the move’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01159" index="1159">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A strong electric blast crashes down\non the target. This may also leave\nthe target with paralysis.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01160" index="1160">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wicked thunderbolt is dropped on the\ntarget to inflict damage. This may also\nleave the target with paralysis.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01161" index="1161">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user sets off an earthquake that\nstrikes every Pokémon around it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01162" index="1162">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is hit by a strong\ntelekinetic force. This may also\nlower the target’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01163" index="1163">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user relaxes and lightens its\nbody to move faster. This sharply\nraises the Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01164" index="1164">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user takes a deep breath and\nfocuses so that critical hits land\nmore easily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01165" index="1165">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user waggles a finger and\nstimulates its brain into randomly\nusing nearly any move.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01166" index="1166">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is attacked with an intense\nblast of all-consuming fire.\nThis may also leave the target with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01167" index="1167">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user charges at the target and\nmay make it flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01168" index="1168">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user temporarily empties its mind\nto forget its concerns.\nThis sharply raises the user’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01169" index="1169">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user drains the target’s blood.\nThe user’s HP is restored by half\nthe damage taken by the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01170" index="1170">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user strikes with a simultaneous\nthree-beam attack. This may also\nburn, freeze, or paralyze the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01171" index="1171">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a substitute for itself\nusing some of its own HP.\nThe substitute serves as the user’s decoy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01172" index="1172">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An all-out attack that becomes more\npowerful the less HP the user has.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01173" index="1173">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Unsanitary sludge is hurled at the\ntarget. This may also poison the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01174" index="1174">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lays a trap of spikes at the\nopposing team’s feet. The trap hurts\nPokémon that switch into battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01175" index="1175">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rampages and attacks for\ntwo to three turns. The user then\nbecomes confused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01176" index="1176">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user materializes an odd psychic\nwave to attack the target. This\nattack does physical damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01177" index="1177">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user endures any attack with at\nleast 1 HP. Its chance of failing\nrises if it is used in succession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01178" index="1178">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">While it is asleep, the user\nrandomly uses one of the moves it\nknows.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01179" index="1179">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Using its tough and impressive horn,\nthe user rams into the target with\nno letup.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01180" index="1180">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user switches places with a\nparty Pokémon in waiting and passes\nalong any stat changes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01181" index="1181">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user compels the target to keep\nusing the move it encored for three\nturns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01182" index="1182">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is slammed with a\nsteel-hard tail. This may also lower\nthe target’s Defense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01183" index="1183">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user crunches up the target with\nsharp fangs. This may also lower the\ntarget’s Defense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01184" index="1184">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurls a shadowy blob at the\ntarget. This may also lower the\ntarget’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01185" index="1185">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Two turns after this move is used, a\nhunk of psychic energy attacks the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01186" index="1186">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks in an uproar for\nthree turns. During that time, no\nPokémon can fall asleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01187" index="1187">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by exhaling hot breath\non opposing Pokémon. This may also leave\nthose Pokémon with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01188" index="1188">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is taunted into a rage\nthat allows it to use only attack\nmoves for three turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01189" index="1189">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user catches the target off\nguard and swaps its held item with\nits own.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01190" index="1190">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the target with great\npower. However, this also lowers\nthe user’s Attack and Defense stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01191" index="1191">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user employs its psychic power\nto exchange Abilities with the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01192" index="1192">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user launches a kick that lands\na critical hit more easily.\nThis may also leave the target with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01193" index="1193">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lets loose a horribly\nechoing shout with the power to\ninflict damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01194" index="1194">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the target at full\npower. The attack’s recoil harshly\nlowers the user’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01195" index="1195">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user absorbs a mystical power\nfrom space to raise its Defense and\nSp. Def stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01196" index="1196">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by shooting muddy\nwater at opposing Pokémon.\nThis may also lower their accuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01197" index="1197">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hardens its body’s surface like\niron, sharply raising its Defense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01198" index="1198">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slashes the target with\nhuge sharp claws.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01199" index="1199">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tenses its muscles to bulk\nup its body, raising both its Attack\nand Defense stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01200" index="1200">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user quietly focuses its mind\nand calms its spirit to raise its\nSp. Atk and Sp. Def stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01201" index="1201">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user handles a sharp leaf like a sword\nand attacks by cutting its target.\nCritical hits land more easily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01202" index="1202">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user vigorously performs a\nmystic, powerful dance that raises\nits Attack and Speed stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01203" index="1203">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tackles the target with a\nhigh-speed spin. The slower the user is than\nthe target, the greater the move’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01204" index="1204">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user fights the target up close without\nguarding itself. This also lowers the user’s\nDefense and Sp. Def stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01205" index="1205">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lays a trap of poison spikes at\nthe opposing team’s feet. They poison\nopposing Pokémon that switch into battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01206" index="1206">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user cloaks itself in fire and charges\nthe target. This also damages the user quite\na lot. This may leave the target with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01207" index="1207">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lets loose a blast of aura power\nfrom deep within its body at the target.\nThis attack never misses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01208" index="1208">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is stabbed with a tentacle,\narm, or the like steeped in poison.\nThis may also poison the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01209" index="1209">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user releases a horrible aura\nimbued with dark thoughts. This may\nalso make the target flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01210" index="1210">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams a barrage of\nhard-shelled seeds down on the\ntarget from above.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01211" index="1211">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slashes at the target by\ncrossing its scythes or claws as if\nthey were a pair of scissors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01212" index="1212">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user generates a damaging sound\nwave by vibration. This may also\nlower the target’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01213" index="1213">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is attacked with a shock\nwave generated by the user’s gaping\nmouth.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01214" index="1214">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with a ray of light\nthat sparkles as if it were made of\ngemstones.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01215" index="1215">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user heightens its mental focus and\nunleashes its power.\nThis may also lower the target’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01216" index="1216">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user draws power from nature and fires\nit at the target.\nThis may also lower the target’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01217" index="1217">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tucks in its wings and charges\nfrom a low altitude.\nThis also damages the user quite a lot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01218" index="1218">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user makes the ground under the target\nerupt with power.\nThis may also lower the target’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01219" index="1219">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stimulates its brain by\nthinking bad thoughts. This sharply\nraises the user’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01220" index="1220">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user focuses its willpower to its head\nand attacks the target.\nThis may also make the target flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01221" index="1221">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user gathers all its light energy\nand releases it all at once.\nThis may also lower the target’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01222" index="1222">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user whips up a storm of leaves\naround the target. The attack’s recoil\nharshly lowers the user’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01223" index="1223">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user violently whirls its vines,\ntentacles, or the like to harshly\nlash the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01224" index="1224">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots filthy garbage at\nthe target to attack. This may also\npoison the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01225" index="1225">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams the target with its\nsteel-hard head. This may also make\nthe target flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01226" index="1226">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stabs the target from below\nwith sharpened stones. Critical hits\nland more easily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01227" index="1227">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lays a trap of levitating stones\naround the opposing team. The trap hurts\nopposing Pokémon that switch into battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01228" index="1228">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user snares the target with grass\nand trips it. The heavier the target,\nthe greater the move’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01229" index="1229">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user strikes everything around it by\nswamping the area with a giant sludge wave.\nThis may also poison those hit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01230" index="1230">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams into the target with its\nheavy body. The more the user outweighs\nthe target, the greater the move’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01231" index="1231">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurls an electric orb at the target.\nThe faster the user is than the target,\nthe greater the move’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01232" index="1232">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user turns the target’s power against it.\nThe higher the target’s Attack stat, the\ngreater the damage it deals.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01233" index="1233">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the target with stored\npower. The more the user’s stats are\nraised, the greater the move’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01234" index="1234">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user teleports using a strange\npower and switches places with one\nof its allies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01235" index="1235">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots boiling hot water at\nits target. This may also leave the\ntarget with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01236" index="1236">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user is roused, and its Attack\nand Sp. Atk stats increase.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01237" index="1237">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shrouds itself in electricity\nand smashes into its target.\nThis also damages the user a little.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01238" index="1238">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user crashes into its target\nwhile rotating its body like a drill.\nCritical hits land more easily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01239" index="1239">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams its target with its flame-\ncovered body. The more the user outweighs\nthe target, the greater the move’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01240" index="1240">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by wrapping its opponent\nin a fierce wind that flies up into the sky.\nThis may also confuse the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01241" index="1241">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user plays rough with the target\nand attacks it.\nThis may also lower the target’s Attack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01242" index="1242">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Opposing Pokémon are drenched in an odd\npoisonous liquid. This lowers the Attack, Sp.\nAtk, and Speed stats of a poisoned target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01243" index="1243">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user damages opposing Pokémon by\nemitting a powerful flash.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01244" index="1244">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user swings both arms and hits\nthe target. The target’s stat changes\ndon’t affect this attack’s damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01245" index="1245">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user fiercely attacks the target\nusing its entire body.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01246" index="1246">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the target’s throat, and\nthe resultant suffering prevents the target\nfrom using sound-based moves for two turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01247" index="1247">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the enemy with a pollen\npuff that explodes. If the target is an\nally, it restores their HP instead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01248" index="1248">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user bites the target with its\npsychic capabilities. This can also\ndestroy Light Screen and Reflect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01249" index="1249">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams into the target using\na full-force blast of water. This may\nalso lower the target’s Defense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01250" index="1250">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by slamming its body into\nthe target. The higher the user’s Defense,\nthe more damage it can inflict on the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01251" index="1251">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is slugged by a punch\nthrown with muscle-packed power.</language>
	</row>
