	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01273" index="1273">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Throw one into a Pokémon Den to\nattract a wild Dynamax Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01274" index="1274">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Strange earbuds that allow you to\nfreely control the volume of various\nsounds.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01275" index="1275">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThe syrupy fruits give off\na strong tropical feel.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01276" index="1276">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rMelted cheese can really\ngive a curry some richness.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01277" index="1277">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThere are over fifty spices\ncontained within this\ningredient’s hot flavor.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01278" index="1278">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rAdd some whipped cream to\na spicy curry to give it\nsome sweetness.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01279" index="1279">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rUsing packaged curry helps\nmake sure there are no\nslipups when cooking.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01280" index="1280">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rThe refined sweetness of\nthis coconut milk makes\nit quite popular.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01281" index="1281">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rIt has a junk-food sort\nof taste, but it goes\nwell with curry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01282" index="1282">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients\nthat can be used for cooking\nat your camp.\rIf you’re unsure about what\nto cook, you can’t go wrong\nwith some burger.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01283" index="1283">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One of the many ingredients that can\nbe used for cooking at your camp.\nA mysterious spice.\rEven a tiny sprinkle is sure to\nmake a curry gigantic.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01284" index="1284">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Toss a number of them into a Pokémon\nDen for the chance to attract a wild\nDynamax Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01285" index="1285">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This bike can be combined with the\nPokémon Rotom to not only do a turbo\nboost but also run on the water.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01286" index="1286">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Having one of these mysterious,\nunshakable charms makes it more\nlikely you’ll get a critical catch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01287" index="1287">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">- - -</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01288" index="1288">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A letter entrusted to you by a girl,\nto be delivered to a boy.\nStrangely, it looks old to you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01289" index="1289">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s signed by all members of the Galar\nregion’s most charismatic band,\nthe Maximizers.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01290" index="1290">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Sonia’s published writings.\nHer new discoveries about the Galar region’s\nlegends are recorded in this enjoyable read.</language>
	</row>
