		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">- - -</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01713" index="1713">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious charm that tends to be\nlost before any other item when you\nfaint in the field.\rThis type of charm comes in five\ndifferent colors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01714" index="1714">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious charm that tends to be\nlost before any other item when you\nfaint in the field.\rThis type of charm comes in five\ndifferent colors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01715" index="1715">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mushrooms that, when consumed, cause\nthe muscles to swell. They imbue the\neater with strength and are one of\rthe materials needed for crafting\nAux Powers.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01716" index="1716">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mushrooms that, when consumed,\nmake the body of the eater\ngrow tougher.\rThey boost endurance and are\none of the materials needed\nfor crafting Aux Guards.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01717" index="1717">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mushrooms that, when consumed,\nmake the eater feel nimble and\nagile as a fleeting shadow.\rThey are one of the materials\nneeded for crafting Aux Evasions.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01718" index="1718">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mushrooms that, when consumed,\nsharpen the eater’s focus. They make\nit easier to land critical hits and\rare one of the materials needed for\ncrafting Dire Hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01719" index="1719">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This bitter root, originally native\nto sandy beaches, can now be raised\neven in frozen soil. It is pickled\rto make a sweet and spicy treat\nknown as Twice-Spiced Radishes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01720" index="1720">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious charm that tends to be\nlost before any other item when you\nfaint in the field.\rThis type of charm comes in five\ndifferent colors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01721" index="1721">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious charm that tends to be\nlost before any other item when you\nfaint in the field.\rThis type of charm comes in five\ndifferent colors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01722" index="1722">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A sweet-fleshed truffle that is\npacked full of mysterious energy. It\nis one of the materials needed for\rcrafting various items.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01723" index="1723">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A type of field provision that\nenhances the flavor of other foods\nit is mixed with.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01724" index="1724">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious ball that can be thrown\nat wild Pokémon in order to catch\nthem.\rThese balls can be crafted by hand\nif you gather the necessary materials.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01725" index="1725">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious ball that provides a higher\nsuccess rate for catching Pokémon\nthan a standard Poké Ball does.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01726" index="1726">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious ball that provides an even\nhigher success rate for catching Pokémon\nthan a Great Ball does.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01727" index="1727">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A ball that flies fast and true-ideal for\ncatching nimble Pokémon or Pokémon\nthat fly high in the air.</language>
	</row>
