	<row id="msg_0221_01730" index="1730">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When thrown at the ground, these\nballs produce a loud noise and scare\noff low-level Pokémon in the area,\rsending them running.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01731" index="1731">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When thrown at the ground, these\nballs produce a cloud of fine powder\nthat will reduce visibility in the\rarea and keep wild Pokémon from\nnoticing you.</language>
	</row>
