	<row id="msg_0221_01734" index="1734">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wooden toy carved in\nthe image of a Pokémon.\nIt can be sold to the general store.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01735" index="1735">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A balm that gives off a soothing scent.\nIt can be used to help calm the frenzy\nof the Lord of the Isles, Arcanine.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01736" index="1736">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A balm that gives off a soothing scent.\nIt can be used to help calm the frenzy\nof the Lord of the Hollow, Electrode.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01737" index="1737">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A balm that gives off a soothing scent.\nIt can be used to help calm the frenzy\nof the Lord of the Tundra, Avalugg.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01738" index="1738">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cake made by combining\nhoney with a Cake-Lure\nBase.\rThese cakes are potently effective\nat attracting bug Pokémon and also\nthose with fairylike charms.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01739" index="1739">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cake made by combining\ngrains with a Cake-Lure\nBase.\rThese cakes are potently effective\nat attracting Pokémon that dwell\nand wander among the fields.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01740" index="1740">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cake made by combining\nbeans with a Cake-Lure\nBase.\rThese cakes are potently effective\nat attracting fish Pokémon, as well\nas bird Pokémon and their flying ilk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01741" index="1741">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cake made by combining\nmushrooms with a Cake-Lure\nBase.\rThese cakes are potently effective at\nattracting the more monstrous Pokémon,\nas well as dragon Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01742" index="1742">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cake made by combining\nsalt with a Cake-Lure\nBase.\rThese cakes are potently effective at\nattracting Pokémon that bear a resemblance\nto grass, plants, or minerals.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01743" index="1743">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A recipe for crafting Swap Snacks\nfrom scratch. Required materials: 1\nCandy Truffle, 1 Sootfoot Root, 1\rSpringy Mushroom, and 1 Hopo Berry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01744" index="1744">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A recipe for crafting Choice\nDumplings from scratch. Required\nmaterials: 3 Caster Fern leaves, 1\rDireshroom, 1 bunch of Swordcap, and\n2 stalks of Hearty Grains.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01745" index="1745">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A recipe for crafting Twice-Spiced\nRadishes from scratch. Required\nmaterials: 2 Sand Radishes, 2 hunks\rof Crunchy Salt, 2 pods of Plump\nBeans, and 2 bunches of King’s Leaf.</language>
	</row>
