		<language name="English">- - -</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01790" index="1790">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An ore of mysterious power, spoken of\nin ancient myths and said to contain\nthe power of almighty Sinnoh itself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01791" index="1791">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by Dialga.\nThis large, glowing gem wells with power\nand allows the Pokémon to change form.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01792" index="1792">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by Palkia.\nThis large, glowing orb wells with power\nand allows the Pokémon to change form.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01793" index="1793">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by Giratina.\nThis large, glowing gem wells with power\nand allows the Pokémon to change form.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01794" index="1794">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A stone tablet imbued\nwith the essence of\nnormalcy.\rWhen used on a certain Pokémon,\nit allows that Pokémon to gain\nthe power of the Normal type.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01795" index="1795">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">- - -</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01796" index="1796">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A kit containing everything you\nmight need for crafting, even when\nthere is no workbench around.\rHowever, you can only use the\nmaterials you have in your satchel.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01797" index="1797">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A recipe for crafting Leaden Balls from\nscratch. Required materials: 1 Apricorn,\n1 Black Tumblestone, and 1 Iron Chunk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01798" index="1798">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A recipe for crafting Gigaton Balls from\nscratch. Required materials: 1 Apricorn,\n2 Black Tumblestone, and 2 Iron Chunk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01799" index="1799">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">- - -</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01800" index="1800">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A volume for compiling the\ncollected results of much\nPokémon research.\rProfessor Laventon continually\nadds to it with each report made\non new Pokémon species.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01801" index="1801">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Part of a series of old poems\nthat have been unearthed\naround the Hisui region.\rJudging from the handwriting,\nit appears they were all\nwritten by the same person.</language>
