	<row id="msg_0221_01822" index="1822">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A small shard that emanates an enigmatic\npower. Inside the shard, you can see a\npattern that looks like Ramanas roses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01823" index="1823">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A large shard that emanates an enigmatic\npower. Inside the shard, you can see a\npattern that looks like Ramanas roses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01824" index="1824">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A single-use drill to bore a hole in\nthe wall for your Secret Base.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01825" index="1825">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A slate overflowing with enigmatic energy.\nYou can feel a strong connection between\nit and the Kanto Room at Ramanas Park.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01826" index="1826">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A slate overflowing with enigmatic energy.\nYou can feel a strong connection between\nit and the Johto Room at Ramanas Park.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01827" index="1827">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A slate overflowing with enigmatic energy.\nYou can feel a strong connection between\nit and the Soul Room at Ramanas Park.</language>
	</row>
