	<row id="msg_0221_01842" index="1842">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A stone tablet imbued with\nthe essence of all\ncreation.\rWhen used on a certain Pokémon,\nit allows that Pokémon to gain\nthe power of every type there is.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01843" index="1843">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The latest model of smartphone.\nA Pokémon called Rotom lives within it, and\nit can be used to run all sorts of handy apps.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01844" index="1844">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dish made by sandwiching vegetables,\nmeat, or other ingredients between\ntwo pieces of bread.\rIt makes a fantastic meal when out on a\npicnic.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01845" index="1845">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Poké Ball that can hold the mysterious\nPokémon known as Koraidon.\nA boy named Arven gave it to you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01846" index="1846">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Poké Ball that can hold the mysterious\nPokémon known as Miraidon.\nA boy named Arven gave it to you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01847" index="1847">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An orb that holds within it the power\nto crystallize. When it is charged with\nenergy, it can be used to Terastallize.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01848" index="1848">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A record of the expedition that the author,\nHeath, went on within the Great Crater\nof Paldea.\rThe book has the name “Sada” written on it\nin clumsy handwriting.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01849" index="1849">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A record of the expedition that the author,\nHeath, went on within the Great Crater\nof Paldea.\rThe book has the name “Turo” written on it\nin clumsy handwriting.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_01850" index="1850">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wallet that was left behind\nby Kofu, the Gym Leader at\nthe Cascarrafa Gym.\rYou’re to deliver it to him\nat the market in Porto Marinada.</language>
	</row>
