	<row id="msg_0221_02167" index="2167">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Material accidentally dropped by\na Pokémon.\nIt can be used to make TMs.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02168" index="2168">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Material accidentally dropped by\na Pokémon.\nIt can be used to make TMs.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02169" index="2169">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Material accidentally dropped by\na Pokémon.\nIt can be used to make TMs.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02170" index="2170">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Material accidentally dropped by\na Pokémon.\nIt can be used to make TMs.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02171" index="2171">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user vigorously performs a\nmystic, powerful dance that boosts\nits Attack and Speed stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02172" index="2172">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with a ray of light\nthat sparkles as if it were made of\ngemstones.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02173" index="2173">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots filthy garbage at\nthe foe to attack. It may also\npoison the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02174" index="2174">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user makes a copy of itself\nusing some of its HP. The copy\nserves as the user’s decoy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02175" index="2175">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hardens its body’s surface\nlike iron, sharply raising its\nDefense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02176" index="2176">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slashes at the foe by\ncrossing its scythes or claws as if\nthey were a pair of scissors.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02177" index="2177">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rotates its body like a\ndrill. It has a high critical-hit\nratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02178" index="2178">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots a sinister, bluish\nwhite flame at the foe to inflict a\nburn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02179" index="2179">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user crunches up the foe with\nsharp fangs. It may also lower the\ntarget’s Defense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02180" index="2180">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user catches the foe off guard\nand swaps the foe’s held item with\nits own.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02181" index="2181">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams into the target using\na full-force blast of water. This may\nalso lower the target’s Defense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02182" index="2182">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nutrient-draining attack. The\nuser’s HP is restored by half the\ndamage taken by the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02183" index="2183">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user looses a blast of aura\npower from deep within its body.\nThis move is certain to hit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02184" index="2184">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user whips up a turbulent\nwhirlwind that ups the Speed of all\nparty Pokémon for three turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02185" index="2185">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurls a shadowy blob at the\nfoe. It may also lower the foe’s Sp.\nDef stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02186" index="2186">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked with a shock\nwave generated by the user’s gaping\nmouth.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02187" index="2187">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lays a trap of levitating\nstones around the foe. The trap\nhurts foes that switch into battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02188" index="2188">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lets loose a horribly\nechoing shout with the power to\ninflict damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02189" index="2189">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user exhales a heated breath on\nthe foe to attack. It may also leave\nthe target with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02190" index="2190">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user draws power from nature and\nfires it at the foe. It may also\nlower the target’s Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02191" index="2191">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit by a strong\ntelekinetic force. It may also\nreduce the foe’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02192" index="2192">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams into the target. The\ngreater the weight difference, the\ngreater the damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02193" index="2193">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user compels the foe to keep\nusing only the move it last used for\nthree to seven turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02194" index="2194">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It swamps the entire battlefield\nwith a giant wave. It can also be\nused for crossing water.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02195" index="2195">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user covers its feet in\nthin ice and twirls around,\nslamming into the target.\rThis move’s spinning motion\nalso destroys the terrain.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02196" index="2196">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is scorched with an intense\nblast of fire. The target may also\nbe left with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02197" index="2197">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A strong electric blast is loosed at\nthe foe. It may also leave the foe\nparalyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02198" index="2198">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by playing rough\nwith the target. This may also lower\nthe target’s Attack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02199" index="2199">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user temporarily empties\nits mind to forget its concerns.\nIt sharply raises the user’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02200" index="2200">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user quietly focuses its mind\nand calms its spirit to raise its\nSp. Atk and Sp. Def stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02201" index="2201">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A move that boosts the power of the\nally’s attack in a Double Battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02202" index="2202">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the enemy\nwith a pollen puff that\nexplodes.\rIf the target is an ally,\nit gives the ally a pollen puff\nthat restores its HP instead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02203" index="2203">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user switches places with a\nparty Pokémon in waiting, passing\nalong any stat changes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02204" index="2204">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user makes the ground under the\nfoe erupt with power. It may also\nlower the target’s Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02205" index="2205">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An all-out attack that becomes more\npowerful the less HP the user has.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02206" index="2206">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is struck with an icy-cold\nbeam of energy. It may also freeze\nthe target solid.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02207" index="2207">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user turns the ground into\nElectric Terrain for five turns,\npowering up Electric-type moves.\rPokémon on the ground can no longer\nfall asleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02208" index="2208">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user turns the ground into\nGrassy Terrain for five turns.\nThis powers up Grass-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02209" index="2209">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This protects Pokémon on the ground\nfrom priority moves and powers up\nPsychic-type moves for five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02210" index="2210">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This protects Pokémon on the ground from\nstatus conditions and halves damage from\nDragon-type moves for five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02211" index="2211">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stimulates its brain by\nthinking bad thoughts. It sharply\nraises the user’s Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02212" index="2212">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked with an intense\nblast of all-consuming fire. It may\nalso leave the target with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02213" index="2213">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is blasted by a huge volume\nof water launched under great\npressure.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02214" index="2214">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A howling blizzard is summoned to\nstrike the foe. It may also freeze\nthe target solid.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02215" index="2215">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When used with its grass equivalent,\nits power increases and a vast sea\nof fire appears.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02216" index="2216">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When combined with its fire\nequivalent, its power increases and\na rainbow appears.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02217" index="2217">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When used with its water equivalent,\nits power increases and a vast swamp\nappears.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02218" index="2218">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user throws an electrified\ntackle. It hurts the user a little.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02219" index="2219">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by hurling filthy\nsludge at the foe. It may also\npoison the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02220" index="2220">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user sets off an earthquake that\nhits all the Pokémon in the battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02221" index="2221">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stabs the foe with a\nsharpened stone. It has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02222" index="2222">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user vanishes somewhere, then strikes\nthe target on the next turn. This move hits\neven if the target protects itself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02223" index="2223">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user charges at the foe using\nevery bit of its power. The user\nmust rest on the next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02224" index="2224">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is razed by a fiery\nexplosion. The user must rest on the\nnext turn, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02225" index="2225">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with a watery blast.\nThe user must rest on the next turn,\nhowever.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02226" index="2226">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slammed with an enormous\ntree. The user can’t move on the\nnext turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02227" index="2227">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rampages and attacks for\ntwo to three turns. However, it then\nbecomes confused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02228" index="2228">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the foe at full\npower. The attack’s recoil sharply\nreduces the user’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02229" index="2229">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user heightens its mental focus\nand unleashes its power. It may also\nlower the target’s Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02230" index="2230">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A storm of sharp leaves is whipped\nup. The attack’s recoil sharply\nreduces the user’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02231" index="2231">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by wrapping its\nopponent in a fierce wind. This may\nalso confuse the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02232" index="2232">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a bizarre area in\nwhich slower Pokémon get to move\nfirst for five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02233" index="2233">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user vibrates its wings to generate\na damaging sound wave.\nIt may also lower the foe’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02234" index="2234">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked with a powerful\nbeam. The user must rest on the next\nturn to regain its energy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02235" index="2235">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tucks in its wings and\ncharges from a low altitude. The\nuser also takes serious damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02236" index="2236">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user cloaks itself in fire and\ncharges at the foe. The user\nsustains serious damage, too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02237" index="2237">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wicked thunderbolt is dropped on the\nfoe to inflict damage.\nIt may also leave the target paralyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02238" index="2238">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user fights the foe up close without\nguarding itself. It also cuts the user’s\nDefense and Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02239" index="2239">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A two-turn attack.\nThe user gathers light, then blasts\na bundled beam on the second turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02240" index="2240">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Comets are summoned down from the\nsky. The attack’s recoil sharply\nreduces the user’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02241" index="2241">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user fires a beam of steel that\nit collected from its entire body.\nThis also damages the user.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02242" index="2242">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the user has Terastallized,\nit unleashes energy of its\nTera Type.\rThis move inflicts damage using the\nAttack or Sp. Atk stat--whichever is\nhigher for the user.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02243" index="2243">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is scared off, to be\nreplaced by another Pokémon in its\nparty. In the wild, the battle ends.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02244" index="2244">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user boosts the power of the\nElectric move it uses next. It also\nraises the user’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02245" index="2245">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a haze that\neliminates every stat change among\nall the Pokémon engaged in battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02246" index="2246">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A move that leaves the target badly\npoisoned.\nIts poison damage worsens every turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02247" index="2247">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user traps the foe inside a\nharshly raging sandstorm for two to\nfive turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02248" index="2248">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user looses its grudge on the\nmove last used by the foe by cutting\n4 PP from it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02249" index="2249">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gravity is intensified for five\nturns, making moves involving flying\nunusable and negating Levitation.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02250" index="2250">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A projectile is thrown at the\nopponent. A flying Pokémon will fall\nto the ground.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02251" index="2251">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tackles the foe with a\nhigh-speed spin. The slower the\nuser, the greater the damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02252" index="2252">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slaps down the foe’s held\nitem, preventing the item from being\nused during the battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02253" index="2253">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user bites the foe. If the foe\nis holding a Berry, the user eats it\nand gains its effect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02254" index="2254">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user chomps hard on the\nfoe with its sharp front fangs.\nIt cuts the target’s HP to half.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02255" index="2255">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user whirls its fists to send a\nwave of pure vacuum at the foe.\nThis move always goes first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02256" index="2256">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user makes a lunge at the target,\nattacking with full force.\nThis also lowers the target’s Attack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02257" index="2257">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user fiercely attacks the target\nusing its entire body.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02258" index="2258">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user launches sharp icicles\nat the foe.\nIt strikes two to five times in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02259" index="2259">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boiling water is shot at the foe.\nIt may also cause a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02260" index="2260">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams down with fire.\nThe more the user outweighs the foe,\nthe greater the damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02261" index="2261">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user gathers light on the first turn,\nthen fills a blade with the light’s energy\nand attacks on the next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02262" index="2262">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks in an uproar for\ntwo to five turns. Over that time,\nno one can fall asleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02263" index="2263">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user focuses its mind before\nlaunching a punch. It will fail if\nthe user is hit before it is used.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02264" index="2264">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that varies in power\nand type depending on the weather.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02265" index="2265">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gliding on the ground, the user\nattacks the target. This move always\ngoes first on Grassy Terrain.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02266" index="2266">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with energy from\njealousy. This leaves all opposing\nPokémon that have had their stats\rboosted during the turn with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02267" index="2267">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">After making its attack, the user\nrushes back to switch places with a\nparty Pokémon in waiting.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02268" index="2268">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams the target with its\nwings to inflict damage. The target\nis hit twice in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02269" index="2269">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by controlling the\ntarget’s item. This move fails if\nthe foe isn’t holding an item.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02270" index="2270">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lashes out to vent its\nfrustration toward the target. This\nmove’s power is doubled if the\ruser’s stats were lowered during\nthis turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02271" index="2271">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by shooting scales\ntwo to five times in a row. This\nraises Speed but lowers Defense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02272" index="2272">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks everything around it and\nfaints upon using this move. This move’s\npower is boosted on Misty Terrain.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02273" index="2273">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user adds its HP to the foe’s\nHP, then equally shares the combined\nHP with the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02274" index="2274">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hypnotizes itself into\ncopying any stat change made by the\nfoe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02275" index="2275">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A reckless, life- risking tackle. It\nalso damages the user by a fairly\nlarge amount, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02276" index="2276">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that cuts down the\nfoe’s HP to equal the user’s HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02277" index="2277">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stirs up a violent petal\nblizzard and attacks everything\naround it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02278" index="2278">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spurred by desperation, the user attacks\nthe target. This move’s power is doubled\nif the user’s previous move failed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02279" index="2279">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Traps the foe inside a whirlpool\nthat lasts for two to five turns.\nThe user can pass through whirlpools.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02280" index="2280">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by shooting out\nmuddy water. It may also lower the\nfoe’s accuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02281" index="2281">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user electrifies its body and drops onto\nthe target to inflict damage. If this move\nmisses, the user takes damage instead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02282" index="2282">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user traps the foe in an\nelectric net. It also lowers the\nfoe’s Speed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02283" index="2283">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A consecutive three-kick attack that\nbecomes more powerful with each\nsuccessful hit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02284" index="2284">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user properly coaches its ally\nPokémon, boosting their Attack and\nDefense stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02285" index="2285">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The area around the user is swamped by\na giant sludge wave.\nIt may also poison those hit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02286" index="2286">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user throws scorching sand at\nthe target to attack.\nThe target may also be left with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02287" index="2287">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user covers the foe with a mass\nof down that sharply lowers the\nAttack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02288" index="2288">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Two turns after this move is used,\nthe foe is attacked with a hunk of\npsychic energy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02289" index="2289">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks\nthe target with\nits psychic power.\rWhen the ground is Psychic Terrain,\nthis move’s power is boosted and it\ndamages all opposing Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02290" index="2290">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user skitters behind the target\nto attack. This also lowers the\ntarget’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02291" index="2291">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user gathers energy from space\nto raise its Sp. Atk on the first\nturn, then attacks on the next.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02292" index="2292">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the target’s throat,\npreventing the target from using\nsound-based moves for two turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02293" index="2293">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user swings its tough tail\nand attacks opposing Pokémon.\nThis also lowers their Attack stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02294" index="2294">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A horrible sound like scraping metal\nis emitted to sharply reduce the\nfoe’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02295" index="2295">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A move that works differently for\nthe Ghost type than for all the\nother types.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02296" index="2296">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is crushed with an arm, a claw,\nor the like to inflict damage. The attack is\nmore powerful the more HP the foe has left.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02297" index="2297">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user raises its allies’ morale\nwith a draconic cry so that their\nfuture attacks have a heightened\rchance of landing critical hits.\nThis rouses Dragon types more.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02298" index="2298">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the target using its angelic\nvoice. This also confuses the target if its\nstats have been boosted during the turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02299" index="2299">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the target with\nunpleasant sound waves. For two\nturns, the target is prevented from\rrecovering HP through moves,\nAbilities, or held items.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02300" index="2300">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
