		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A bottle emblazoned\nwith the academy’s\nemblem.\rIt’s light, sturdy, and vacuum insulated,\nso it’ll keep your hots hot and your colds\ncold.</language>
