	<row id="msg_0221_02334" index="2334">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The academy’s standard-issue\ntablecloth. It’s made with the\nlatest fiber-processing technology\rand is so tough that not even a\nRazor Claw can tear it.</language>
