	<row id="msg_0221_02340" index="2340">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The academy’s standard-issue ball in\na regulation size. Lots of students\nbelieve that if you kick it right on\rthe academy emblem, it’ll fly in a\nstraight line.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02341" index="2341">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
