		<language name="English">This pick flies a blue flag that\nlends an air of adventure. The flag\nitself is made of card stock, so\rit’ll fly proudly even with no wind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02349" index="2349">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Pick-achu, as it were, sporting\nPikachu’s usual expression. It’s\neasy to grab by the ears, which is\rpart of why it’s so popular.</language>
	</row>
