	<row id="msg_0221_02396" index="2396">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A sandwich pick with a simple red Poké Ball\ndesign. Often used by Trainers who picked a\nFire-type Pokémon for their first partner.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02397" index="2397">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This pick features a small sparkler that\ngoes off automatically.\nIt’s used at parties or for guests of honor.\rIt leaves an oddly appealing aroma once it’s\nburned out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02398" index="2398">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pick made to be the coolest.\nOnce you’ve eaten, you can pretend\nyou’re a hero of legend.\rSouvenir shops at tourist spots\nsell these for some reason.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02399" index="2399">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pick shaped after a magic wand.\nPerhaps the real magic is the food\nmaker’s wish for a delicious dish.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02400" index="2400">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pick shaped after a magic wand.\nPerhaps the real magic is the food\nmaker’s wish for a delicious dish.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02401" index="2401">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Some complain that the parasol part\nof this pick is hard to hold on to,\nso your fingers get messy.\rStill, it’s fun to twirl this all\naround after you’ve eaten.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02402" index="2402">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flower pick designed to evoke\na blue sky. It’s part of a line of\n“sky-flower” picks.\rUsing a few is guaranteed to boost\nthat special picnic spirit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02403" index="2403">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flower pick designed to evoke\na blazing sunset. It’s part of\na line of “sky-flower” picks.\rUsing a few is guaranteed to boost\nthat special picnic spirit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02404" index="2404">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flower pick designed to evoke\na glorious sunrise. It’s part of\na line of “sky-flower” picks.\rUsing a few is guaranteed to boost\nthat special picnic spirit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02405" index="2405">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dish for picnics.\nComes in plenty of colors to choose\nfrom based on the food or the mood.\rThe blue variety is a consistent strong\nseller.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02406" index="2406">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dish for picnics.\nComes in plenty of colors to choose\nfrom based on the food or the mood.\rThe green variety is quite popular.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02407" index="2407">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dish for picnics.\nComes in plenty of colors to choose\nfrom based on the food or the mood.\rThe orange variety is the most popular\nof all.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02408" index="2408">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dish for picnics.\nComes in plenty of colors to choose\nfrom based on the food or the mood.\rThe red variety never fails to sell well.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02409" index="2409">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dish for picnics.\nComes in plenty of colors to choose\nfrom based on the food or the mood.\rThe white variety comes recommended\nby sellers.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02410" index="2410">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dish for picnics.\nComes in plenty of colors to choose\nfrom based on the food or the mood.\rThe yellow variety is impossible to go\nwrong with.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02411" index="2411">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis feather, which gleams faintly in the\nlight, boosts the power of Fairy-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02412" index="2412">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A teacup that can make a certain species\nof Pokémon evolve. It may be cracked,\nbut tea drunk from it is delicious.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02413" index="2413">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A teacup that can make a certain species\nof Pokémon evolve. It may be chipped,\nbut tea drunk from it is delicious.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02414" index="2414">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A teal mask patterned after the face of an\nogre. Ogerpon dropped it while fleeing up the\nstairs after visiting the Festival of Masks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02415" index="2415">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by Ogerpon. This wooden\nmask is adorned with crystals and allows\nOgerpon to wield the Rock type in battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02416" index="2416">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by Ogerpon. This wooden\nmask is adorned with crystals and allows\nOgerpon to wield the Water type in battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02417" index="2417">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item to be held by Ogerpon. This wooden\nmask is adorned with crystals and allows\nOgerpon to wield the Fire type in battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02418" index="2418">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Having one of these cards increases\nthe selection available to you in\nboutiques and hair salons.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02419" index="2419">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cluster of the crystals\nfound within the Crystal\nPool.\rThey sparkle brilliantly and are\napparently necessary to repair\na certain mask.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02420" index="2420">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mochi cake with Berries kneaded into\nits dough. It increases base points for\na Pokémon’s HP stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02421" index="2421">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mochi cake with Berries kneaded into\nits dough. It increases base points for\na Pokémon’s Attack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02422" index="2422">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mochi cake with Berries kneaded into\nits dough. It increases base points for\na Pokémon’s Defense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02423" index="2423">
