		<language name="English">A mochi cake with Berries kneaded into\nits dough. It increases base points for\na Pokémon’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02425" index="2425">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mochi cake with Berries kneaded into\nits dough. It increases base points for\na Pokémon’s Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_02426" index="2426">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A set of chairs that are ideal for picnicking.\nThey have a simple design that can stand up\nto both dirt and physical impacts.</language>
	</row>
